{"product_id":"vaporesso-xros-16w-pod-system","title":"Vaporesso XROS 16W Pod System","description":"\u003cp\u003eDiscover the Vaporesso XROS 16W Pod System, featuring a 800mAh integrated battery, mesh coil heating structure, and adjustable airflow control system. Constructed from durable zinc-alloy, the XROS Pod System delivers delicious clouds of vapor with its mesh coil pods, holding up to 2mL of e-juice or nicotine salts. Offering a 0.8ohm or 1.2ohm mesh coil, the Vaporesso XROS is top filled, removing the ergonomic mouthpiece to reveal fill ports for a convenient fill system. On the back of the Vaporesso XROS Pod System, is an adjustable airflow control switch, allowing or restricting airflow with a simple click.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVaporesso XROS 16W Pod System Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAXON Chipset\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 112mm by 23mm by 13mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 800mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 11-16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStainless Steel Chassis Construction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAuto-Draw or Button Firing Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3 Color LED Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdjustable Airflow Control Switch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2mL Pod Capacity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Fill System - Hidden By Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTransparent Juice Viewing Window\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVaporesso XROS Pod Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.2ohm XROS Mesh Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMagnetic Pod Connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvertime Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOverdischarge Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNo Load Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOvercharging Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eResistance Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOver Voltage Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType-C Port\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable in Blue, Matte Grey, Sky Blue, Silver, Rose Pink, Rainbow\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Vaporesso XROS Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 0.8ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 1.2ohm XROS Pod\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Type-C USB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 User Manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Warranty Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Reminder Card\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vaporesso","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531766014007,"sku":"V XROS Pod System","price":3100.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vaporesso_xros_16w_pod_system_-_all_colors.png?v=1741709811","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/vaporesso-xros-16w-pod-system","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




